@startuml
title SD-S02 — Event and quote commitment
caption To-Be · Event and Settlement · F05/F06 · DEC-020 · TX-05–08
[*] --> Applied : submit eligible event
Applied --> Quoted : issue current quote and record window
Applied --> Declined : merchant records decision
Applied --> Cancelled : owner cancels before acceptance
Applied --> Applied : merchant offers alternate schedule
Quoted --> Quoted : supersede unaccepted revision under schedule lock
Quoted --> AwaitingDeposit : accept current quote and terms
AwaitingDeposit --> DepositReview : timely proof
AwaitingDeposit --> Cancelled : confirmed no transfer, release unused window
AwaitingDeposit --> Expired : deadline without timely proof
Quoted --> Expired : deadline, no timely proof
Quoted --> Cancelled : before accepting
DepositReview --> Booked : verify funds and confirm effective balance deadline [DEC-021]
DepositReview --> Exception : verified late and fulfilment infeasible [DEC-021]
DepositReview --> Cancelled : explicit rejection, release unused window
DepositReview --> Exception : unresolved payment mismatch
Exception --> Booked : agreed reschedule + resource swap + effective balance
Exception --> Proceeding : agreed reschedule and balance already settled
Exception --> Cancelled : documented disposition and refund reconciliation
Booked --> Proceeding : verify original balance
Booked --> BalanceGrace : overdue reminder
BalanceGrace --> Proceeding : verify original balance
BalanceGrace --> Cancelled : after cutoff, merchant confirms no funds and review resolved
BalanceGrace --> Cancelled : merchant inability creates full-refund obligations
BalanceGrace --> BalanceGrace : timely balance proof retains slot through review [DEC-026]
Booked --> Cancelled : merchant inability creates full-refund obligations
Proceeding --> EquipmentCheck : record setup and teardown
Proceeding --> Cancelled : merchant inability creates full-refund obligations
Proceeding --> Proceeding : customer request denied, no refund
EquipmentCheck --> Completed : checked, no extras
EquipmentCheck --> AdditionalBill : itemized separate charge
AdditionalBill --> Completed : verified extra payment
note right of DepositReview
  Worker cannot release a timely reviewed slot.
  Transfer or recorded proof blocks customer cancellation.
end note
@enduml
